+## Sales
+
+- `sales` holds one record per till ticket: `{ id, ticket, soldAt, lines:
+  [{ dishId, qty }] }`. Files without it read as having no sales. A ticket is
+  imported once; importing it again does nothing.
+- Each dish sold uses one portion of its recipe per `qty`, consumed with
+  `ref` `sale:<ticket>` at the ticket's `soldAt`. Importing a file is all or
+  nothing.
+- Variance: theoretical use comes from sales sold on the days asked for,
+  actual use from every `consume` movement on those days; the difference is
+  actual minus theoretical (3 decimals).
